description: Always-on anti-slop UI, gothic editorial typography, WCAG AA contrast, semantic HTML, and French literary copy filter. Reads DESIGN.md and .claude/skills/anti-slop-design/SKILL.md before frontend edits.
globs: **/*
alwaysApply: true
